Z||000008||Galen||08-28-2001||09:45 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by pontiacs4me:<BR><B>I always thought Reattas and fieros shared styling, also.  My dads girlfriend has one, and it is white, as is my fiero, and they were sitting in the driveway beside each other one night, and my dad first made the comment that they looked alot alike.  I looked them over, and they really do.  None of the parts look exactly the same, but if you squint real hard the cars look alot the same.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>If you squint ya eyes real hard a Aztek looks good<BR><P>------------------<BR>Ray -      <A HREF="mailto:galen@ezrpg.com">galen@ezrpg.com</A>      - <A HREF="http://www.fierolinks.f2s.com/" TARGET=_blank>www.FieroLinks.f2s.com</A> - AIM: GalenRPG - ICQ: 98668558||||reg||1
