Z||000019||Fformula88||08-29-2001||04:25 PM||||The Reatta shows us the intelligence of the big wigs at GM! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif">  First, they sit down and decide there isn't enough of a market to make a two-seater car profitable.  So they kill the Fiero! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><BR> <BR>A week later, they are in the board room again trying to figure out what to give Buick, when someone says "Hey, how about a neat little two-seater!  I bet we can sell them like hot-cakes!"  Everyone agreed and they rolled out the Reatta! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"><P>One word... morons!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>John  <BR>AOLIM: Fformula88<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierosig2.JPG"> <BR>1988 Fiero Formula<BR>1985 Fiero SE 2M6||||reg||1
