Z||000021||Cooter||08-29-2001||11:09 PM||||My dad has an 88 Reatta. It is a really nice old car that has aged well, sort of like our cars. The styling is still modern (compared to the other stuff offered by Buick in 1988) and it turns heads everywhere we go.||||reg||1
